# ArduPlane Parameters - Mini Talon Airspeed Overlay (default)
# Apply on top of plane_base.parm for Gazebo wind / pitot worlds.
#
# This is the DEFAULT, production-like Mini Talon airspeed overlay. It enables
# the Gazebo JSON airspeed sensor and keeps the conservative 14/10/22
# cruise/min/max envelope used by the accepted CTE wind-envelope evidence
# (evidence/reports/features/2026-06-02_cte_wind_envelope_result.md). It matches
# the recovered production-era overlay under
# evidence/curated_logs/recovered_param_stacks/.
#
# Aggressive high-wind CTE tuning is intentionally NOT here. For a deliberate
# high-wind stress profile (cruise 28 etc.), name
# config/overlays/plane_airspeed_cte_high_wind_aggressive.parm explicitly.
#
# One-source rule:
# - Gazebo provides wind
# - SITL wind remains disabled

ARSPD_TYPE       100       # JSON airspeed sensor from Gazebo / ArduPilotPlugin
ARSPD_USE        1
ARSPD_AUTOCAL    0         # Do not learn offset from live wind on startup
ARSPD_SKIP_CAL   1         # Keep startup from zeroing in active wind
ARSPD_OFFSET     0

# Production-like Mini Talon airspeed envelope.
AIRSPEED_CRUISE  14
AIRSPEED_MIN     10
AIRSPEED_MAX     22
STALL_PREVENTION 1

SIM_WIND_SPD     0
SIM_WIND_DIR     180
SIM_WIND_TURB    0
AHRS_WIND_MAX    15
